# Johto's Hall of Fame (HeartGold's ceremony): a proud, unhurried hymn in D major, a horn's broad phrases answered by a
# trumpet an octave up, over strings held in whole bars, a walking bass and the timpani on the first beat of each bar,
# for the ceremony in which Johto's new Champion's team is recorded. A place indoors plays the same by day and night.
# Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J12; found by MusicDirector.SceneSong before the common song).
